  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cashew Strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this project the Embassy of the Kingdom of the Netherlands and the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) will formulate a Cashew Strategy that will help the project partners understand the needs of Dutch and Tanzanian private sector, and how these players can be facilitated by the Embassy in the most effective way.By organising platform meetings in which different players in the Cashew sector from both Tanzania and the Netherland can come together and discuss certain topics, the project partners are able to identify the challenges and possible solutions that players in the cashew industry face.The second part of this project is focused on formulating a Cashew Strategy in which it will become clear how the Embassy can target their efforts in enhancing the Cashew industry in an effective way.</narrative>
  </description>
